OL,3,GNEWSANew sauna leaves neighbours hot
OL,4,Aunder the collar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sauna that opened last year without
OL,7,Fgetting planning permission has left
OL,8,Fneighbours feeling hot under the
OL,9,Fcollar.
OL,11,FThe Bristol Sauna Yard is operating on
OL,12,FChurch Road in Redfield, despite being
OL,13,Frefused planning permission. Bristol
OL,14,FCity Council said the case is now being
OL,15,Freviewed by planning enforcement.
OL,17,FResidents living in Church Road Studios
OL,18,Fand the nearby Lacie Court have
OL,19,Fcomplained about noise from customers
OL,20,Fscreaming in plunge pools and the loss
OL,21,Fof privacy.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
