OL,3,GNEWSANew sauna leaves neighbours hot
OL,4,Aunder the collar
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have already taken practical steps
OL,7,Fto reduce the potential impact of the
OL,8,Foperation, including converting
OL,9,Fentirely to electric heating, removing
OL,10,Fwood smoke and installing privacy
OL,11,Fscreening," said Robbie Wallace, from
OL,12,Fthe sauna.
